## 5. Reserved names

- `UNITS_KEY = "units"` defined in `core/units.py`, added to `core/reserved.py: RESERVED_PROPERTIES`.
- `docs/architecture.md`'s reserved-property list gets `units` added alongside `equation`, `unknowns`, `url`, `date`, `duration`, `recurrence`, `gcal_event_id`, `provider`, `configuration`.
- `docs/simulation.md`'s "Not built yet → Units" bullet gets removed/rewritten, with a new section documenting the dimension model, the `strict_units` flag, and the write-back-preserves-declared-unit guarantee (the "Physical property models" section is the closest existing template for tone/depth).

